SuperDAW-MCP Pure Data (Pd) Integration Guide
========================================

Pd can communicate with SuperDAW via the global OSC gateway.

SuperDAW Listener: 127.0.0.1:12001 (UDP)

Pd [netsend] / [udpsend] mapping:
---------------------------------

1. Transport Play
   [1( -> [send /superdaw/transport/play] -> [netsend -u -b]

2. Track Volume
   [0 0.8( -> [send /superdaw/mixer/volume] -> [netsend -u -b]

Required Pd Objects:
--------------------
- mrpeach/osc or built-in [netsend] in Pd 0.52+

Example Patch Logic:
--------------------
[bang]
|
[list /superdaw/mixer/volume 0 0.5]
|
[oscformat]
|
[netsend -u -b]
